    "head_branch": "fix/github-sync-one-issue-per-marker",
    "head_commit_message": "fix(ci): github-sync moves each kept step under its kept parent\n\nSpec 40 step 4's added rule (#551). The sync reads each kept step's parent\nonce a run and, where it isn't the spec's kept parent, attaches it there\nwith replace_parent, open or closed, so steps made under a copy aren't\nleft under a closed duplicate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EeUJm2SEvg586DkCD1ifGW",
